  "blocks": [
    {
      "text": "Datalists are ready-to-use parameters containing key-value pairs that can be used in various decoy personalities and generative AI decoys. Each datalist can have multiple key-value pairs and each key can have multiple values mapped to it. By default, Zscaler Deception provides a list of preconfigured datalists that can be used in Network Decoy personalities (as Active Directory OUs), Active Directory Decoy personalities (as Group Memberships), and Landmine personalities (as Fakes in Defense Evasion), and interactive generative AI decoys (as Model Names). In addition, you can create custom datalists based on your requirements."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Creating a Datalist",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "To create a datalist:"
    },
    {
      "item": "Go to Miragemaker > Miscellaneous > Datalist.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          17
        ],
        [
          20,
          33
        ],
        [
          36,
          44
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Click Add Datalist.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          18
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "In the Datalist Details drawer:",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          7,
          23
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Name: Enter a name for the datalist.",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          4
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "For Item 1, configure the following fields:",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          4,
          10
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Key: Select a key from the drop-down menu that must be associated with the datalist.",
      "depth": 2,
      "number": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          3
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Alternatively, you can create a new key. To create a new key, click Create new key, enter a name for the key, and click Save.",
      "depth": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          68,
          82
        ],
        [
          120,
          124
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 2
    },
    {
      "item": "Value: Enter the values that must be mapped with the selected key. You can add multiple values. Each value must be on a new line.",
      "depth": 2,
      "number": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          5
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "When you select specific keys, the maximum number of values that can be added is restricted to 20.",
      "depth": 2
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 2
    },
    {
      "item": "(Optional) Click Add data to add another item to the datalist and configure the key-value pairs.",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          17,
          25
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "Click Save.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 4,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          10
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Downloading Datalists",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "To download a datalist:"
    },
